{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2022-05-03 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF VICE PRESIDENT - CORPORATE FINANCE ROBIN J. DAVENPORT', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, MAY 03, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE:PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ROBIN J. DAVENPORT, VICE PRESIDENT - CORPORATE FINANCE, WILL RETIRE EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 31, 2022, AFTER 19 YEARS OF DEDICATED SERVICE TO THE COMPANY.'}